          "text_key": "anomaly.budget_cut.response.use_emergency_funding",
          "action": "use_emergency_funding"
        }
      ],
      "design_notes": [
        "The 10% cut applies when the card is drawn; the responses are the ways to absorb it. Emergency Funding is the PM ability of roles.json (+10% budget once). The design does not say what happens if the build still fits the reduced budget, or if the ability is already used."
      ]
    },
    {
